{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>由 Zypong.com 發行的 3D 第一人稱精準平台遊戲 GetHigh.EXE，現於 Epic Games 開放 PC 限時免費，截止時間為 11 月 2 日 23:00（香港時間）。作品以垂直攀爬與高難度跳躍為核心，玩家要在約 350 米高的關卡中運用精確移動一路向上。</p>\n<p>玩家會穿梭於熟悉的跑酷障礙賽道，面對移動平台、旋轉障礙與嚴苛跳躍，目標是爬到最高點。遊戲提供可選擇的 Checkpoint 導航，方便練習與掌握路線；操作支援鍵盤與滑鼠，也對應控制器。</p>\n<p>除了主線攀爬，關卡內藏有 Secret Cookies 供探索者尋找；視覺採復古未來合成器浪潮世界，配合街機式玩法。官方提到 beta 測試時 10 名玩家中有 6 名能完成遊戲，顯示難度雖高但仍可通關。</p>\n<img alt=\"【PC】垂直精準跑酷遊戲 GetHigh.EXE 限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ss-D8cecdd7ca0f1607326d2ddad34ee37e99c53642-1920x1080-1.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"【PC】垂直精準跑酷遊戲 GetHigh.EXE 限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ss-B5564293a2e6a604f4d8ea2d450a3068e01e297c-1920x1080-1.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"【PC】垂直精準跑酷遊戲 GetHigh.EXE 限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ss-B5ef0f16cb15c8061d5ed1332e336f363f7f3e7a-1920x1080-1.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"【PC】垂直精準跑酷遊戲 GetHigh.EXE 限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ss-Dd1b8755c4c892bb940aa3232eee08377078ef41-1920x1080-1.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"【PC】垂直精準跑酷遊戲 GetHigh.EXE 限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Ss-30f954383fa26a023f8ee57ea7cae860cd497dfe-1920x1080-1.jpg\">\n<p>遊戲名稱：GetHigh.EXE<br/>支援平台：Windows<br/>領取位置：Epic Games</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T17:39:55.523852+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":381,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:32:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T11:58:17.215541+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T17:38:14.961407+00:00","content_hash":"5f494e329ac9b4bfffd830afa9537372be65319aa0e8408b74b0045c8981532c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}